Error: Jet.DynWrapNotAllowed: `Plain` does not wrap into `Dyn` automatically
  --> Tests/UI/serde_generated_cascade_keeps_user_impl_error.jet:8:35
    |
  8 |         encode: fn(self) -> Dyn { Plain{} }
    |                                   ^^^^^^^
 Why: Only primitive data and recursively wrappable collections wrap automatically
 Fix: Write `Dyn.from(value)` (the type must implement `Encode`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.DynWrapNotAllowed
